msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"You ruined Setsuko's life, and you killed Mom... You didn't pay your debts, "
"and now this is what you get!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Tatsuo... But why...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Hold it!"
msgstr "Fermo!"

msgctxt "128"
msgid "It's you... Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"I know you've been through a lot. But that's no reason to kill your own "
"father, and you know it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "164"
msgid "You've done enough. Your mother would never have wanted this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Shut up! Just shut up! What the hell do you know about it, anyway!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "Cosa...?"

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"My father told me everything. If... if you hadn't shown up at his office..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Yeah... I get it now. It all started with you! <Italic>You're</Italic> the "
"one who destroyed my family!"
msgstr ""

